      "content": "honoring a memory doesn't change the fact that the silence is still there. it feels like i'm just going through the motions for a world that doesn't even matter. everything feels so heavy and pointless. sometimes i just sit here thinking that maybe staying around is just... more unnecessary effort. like, if the best part is gone, why keep playing the game?",
